WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:03.910
After beating Team Q4, 
I'll take power-degozaru!

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:07.570
I ride Goddess of the Full Moon, Tsukuyomi!

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:14.130
I got it! What good luck!

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:19.560
My goddess in her bathing suit 
waved to me from the pool...

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:21.170
Um...

00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:24.630
This will be my first time 
fighting with you, right-deojaru?

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:28.090
Now that you mention it, I've 
never even seen you fight, Miwa.

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:34.580
Who do you think used to 
be Kai's practice partner?

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:38.590
Are you ready?

00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:14.580
And now, the last match of the finals

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:17.490
Sorry, we've got a full house.

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:17.950
of the Card Capital Shop Tournament!

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:21.780
First, from the reigning champions, Team Q4,

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:23.230
Aichi Sendou!

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:28.610
And seeking to overthrow them,

00:02:28.610 --> 00:02:31.050
from Team Overthrow,

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:33.010
Miwa, Chief Councilor of State, Crown Prince!

00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:41.880
Despite this being his first participation in a tournament,
Crown Prince Miwa has managed to make it all the way here!

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:45.200
So even Team Q4 had better 
not let down their guard!

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:50.470
Miwa has never been in a 
tournament before this?

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:55.070
Nope. I thought he wasn't interested in 
participating in this kind of thing...

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:59.210
But this time he came to us and 
demanded we let him on the team.

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:03.540
Hohohoho-deojaru!

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:07.120
Don't worry, Kamui the Great!

00:03:07.690 --> 00:03:11.210
There's no way he'll lose against someone 
playing in a tournament for the first time!

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:12.760
NW, yo!

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:14.140
Y-Yeah...

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:21.800
Miwa's Ability

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:28.400
Miwa, what kind of fight 
are you going to give me?

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:48.670
I just heard a voice...

00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:50.360
All right, please begin.

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:54.670
Are you ready?

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:55.570
Y-Yes...

00:03:55.570 --> 00:03:57.570
Then 1, 2...

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:58.670
Stand Up,

00:03:59.020 --> 00:04:00.110
Vanguard!

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:01.740
Barcgal!

00:04:03.310 --> 00:04:06.300
Lizard Runner, Undeux-deojaru!

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:08.150
Undeux?

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:13.460
You have the first move-deojaru.

00:04:13.460 --> 00:04:14.770
Right...

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:16.680
I've gotta concentrate on the fight...

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:23.350
I ride the Little Sage, Marron!

00:04:23.790 --> 00:04:25.260
Barcgal moves to the rear-guard.

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:28.850
With Barcgal's skill, I call Flogal!

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:31.390
That's the end of my turn.

00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:34.570
It's Maro's turn... And I draw-deojaru.

00:04:35.950 --> 00:04:38.700
I ride Embodiment of Armor, Bahr!

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:43.960
I call Dragon Dancer, Monica 
and Flame Seed Salamander!

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:47.690
With a boost from Flame Seed Salamander,

00:04:47.690 --> 00:04:49.790
Monica attacks!

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:57.690
Damage check!

00:04:58.120 --> 00:05:04.740
And now, maybe I'll have your troublesome 
doggy, who can call his friends, exit the field.

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:07.880
Flame Seed Salamander's skill

00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:11.710
is making a grade 0 unit exit the field

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:16.880
whenever it boosts a Kagero unit 
that has a successful attack!

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:23.550
Barcgal!

00:05:25.690 --> 00:05:29.210
And now that that's dealt 
with, I attack with Bahr.

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:33.140
Drive check.

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:37.380
Damage check!

00:05:40.300 --> 00:05:42.950
A critical trigger, right from the start...

00:05:42.950 --> 00:05:44.880
CT... Talk about unlucky!

00:05:46.760 --> 00:05:48.780
Nice draw!

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:50.860
Keep it up, Ojaru-degozaru!

00:05:52.670 --> 00:05:55.170
Maro is strong-deojaru!

00:05:55.900 --> 00:06:00.200
That's right. Miwa is always with Kai...

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:01.900
Of course he's strong.

00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:04.470
But so am I...

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:05.710
I draw!

00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:11.090
Here I go! Stand up, my avatar!

00:06:11.090 --> 00:06:14.590
I ride Blaster Blade!

00:06:19.340 --> 00:06:21.170
Bring it on.

00:06:21.510 --> 00:06:24.280
I call Gallatin and two Pongals!

00:06:28.100 --> 00:06:29.470
I attack Bahr with Gallatin!

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:34.530
I guard with Iron Tail Dragon-deojaru!

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:44.260
See? What's next?

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:46.510
With a boost from Flogal...

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:50.670
Here I go!

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:53.880
Drive check!

00:06:55.570 --> 00:06:57.620
Critical trigger?!

00:06:57.620 --> 00:07:00.490
I add +5000 to the power of Pongal.

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:09.420
With a boost from Pongal, 
my other Pongal attacks!

00:07:15.770 --> 00:07:17.970
Damage check-deojaru.

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:20.470
That's the end of my turn.

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:23.170
Maro stands and draws!

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:27.610
I ride Dragon Knight, Nehalem!

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:33.500
Monica moves to the rear-guard!

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:39.460
I call Chain-attack Sutherland 
and Berserk Dragon!

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:46.290
I activate Berserk's skill.

00:07:46.620 --> 00:07:50.660
I can make one unit exit the field-deojaru!

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:52.370
Gallatin...

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:55.570
I activate Sutherland's skill.

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:58.690
When an opponent's unit 
is sent to the Drop Zone,

00:07:58.690 --> 00:08:01.100
+3000 is added to his power!

00:08:02.420 --> 00:08:05.260
Sutherland attacks.

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:16.560
There we go! I'm on a roll!

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:21.480
I guard with Llew!

00:08:24.180 --> 00:08:25.800
Drive check...

00:08:26.740 --> 00:08:28.660
Here we go! Heal trigger!

00:08:30.180 --> 00:08:34.070
I add +5000 to the power 
of Berserk and then this...

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:43.570
Maro still has an attack left-deojaru.

00:08:43.610 --> 00:08:45.690
With a boost from Monica,

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:47.820
Berserk attacks!

00:08:57.860 --> 00:08:59.330
Damage trigger check!

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:09.100
What do you think of Maro's skill-deojaru?

00:09:09.100 --> 00:09:12.420
And I'm just warming up here...

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:36.030
He's got the upper hand!

00:09:36.410 --> 00:09:39.200
Are we really gonna overthrow them?!

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:42.040
You're seeing the dawn of a 
new age before your very eyes!

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:43.670
Aichi...

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:46.660
He really is strong...

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:50.390
Huh? Are you scared?

00:09:50.390 --> 00:09:53.730
I thought you'd show me 
more of a good time...

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:55.970
Or maybe I expected too much...

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:03.000
It's my turn! I stand and draw!

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:05.400
All right, I forgive you, Aichi! 
You can go ahead and lose.

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:11.000
Then I'll get my big moment with Kourin!

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:13.310
This guy's back to his normal self...

00:10:17.430 --> 00:10:20.320
I ride Solitary Knight, Gancelot!

00:10:26.940 --> 00:10:29.140
I call Young Pegasus Knight!

00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:33.520
Counterblast!

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:39.040
By putting Pongal in the Soul,

00:10:39.040 --> 00:10:41.330
I can add Soul Saver Dragon to my hand.

00:10:43.640 --> 00:10:48.070
And when I put a card in the Soul, I can 
add +3000 to the power of Pegasus Knight!

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:52.340
One more!

00:10:56.030 --> 00:10:59.320
And I add one more Soul 
Saver Dragon to my hand.

00:10:59.950 --> 00:11:02.210
Two Soul Saver Dragon units...?

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:09.600
I call Soul Saver Dragon!

00:11:14.530 --> 00:11:15.970
Wow...

00:11:16.830 --> 00:11:18.710
Gancelot's Counterblast!

00:11:21.150 --> 00:11:23.290
Triple Counterblast!

00:11:23.290 --> 00:11:24.690
He's rallying!

00:11:27.970 --> 00:11:30.640
I attack Nehalem with Pegasus Knight!

00:11:39.520 --> 00:11:41.280
Damage check...

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:44.320
Then, with a boost from Flogal...

00:11:44.750 --> 00:11:46.200
Please, Flogal!

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:58.330
I guard with Dragon Monk, Genjo!

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:04.170
Berserk Dragon!

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:05.920
Intercept!

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:11.710
Twin drive, first check!

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:14.220
Second check!

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:16.750
Yes! Critical trigger!

00:12:16.890 --> 00:12:17.440
But...

00:12:18.450 --> 00:12:22.420
Even with +5000 power, Gancelot's 
attack won't get through...

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:27.810
I give the +5000 power and the 
+1 critical to Soul Saver Dragon!

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:46.210
Soul Saver Dragon, it's in your hands!

00:12:59.200 --> 00:13:01.150
Damage trigger check!

00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:06.560
Draw trigger...

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:08.610
I can add one more card to my hand.

00:13:10.540 --> 00:13:12.500
Now he's at 5 damage!

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:15.450
TA, yo! He can turn this around!

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:20.660
Man, this is a real nail-biter...

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:24.020
Well, Aichi Sendou <i>was</i> a participant 
in the national tournament...

00:13:24.020 --> 00:13:26.380
I know, but even he...

00:13:26.380 --> 00:13:30.100
Yeah, if he can't manage a full-on 
assault here, it's not gonna be pretty.

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:33.230
This is awesome! They're 
both strong fighters!

00:13:33.230 --> 00:13:34.940
Which side's gonna win?!

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:37.810
Yeah! You can do it!

00:13:37.810 --> 00:13:39.740
Just keep doin' what you're doin', Ojaru!

00:13:39.740 --> 00:13:42.740
You're not my third disciple for nothing!

00:13:42.740 --> 00:13:44.170
When did that happen...?

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:46.330
Go for it, Ojaru!

00:13:46.330 --> 00:13:48.090
They really are gonna overthrow Q4!

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:50.570
Don't back down, Team Q4!

00:13:50.570 --> 00:13:51.980
That's right!

00:13:52.590 --> 00:13:54.250
Very nice.

00:13:54.250 --> 00:13:56.480
This is a wonderful final match.

00:13:57.600 --> 00:13:59.890
Thanks for the support, everyone!

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:04.510
Well, I think I'll meet their expectations...

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:10.280
Here I go!

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:12.340
Final Turn!

00:14:15.860 --> 00:14:17.060
Miwa...

00:14:19.490 --> 00:14:22.570
I ride Garnet Dragon Flash!

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:29.980
I call Embodiment of Spear, Tahr!

00:14:32.990 --> 00:14:37.280
Its apocalyptic flames will reduce 
everything in this world to ash...

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:43.430
Dragonic Overlord!

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:48.090
This is...!

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:51.230
Now, it's time for the main show.

00:14:51.230 --> 00:14:55.260
I attack Blaster Blade 
with Dragonic Overlord!

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:00.250
Check the trigger...

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:03.890
Got it! Drive trigger activated!

00:15:04.230 --> 00:15:09.060
Tahr's skill adds +5000 to 
Dragonic Overlord's attack power!

00:15:15.690 --> 00:15:20.500
And the effect of the critical 
trigger adds +1 to the damage!

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:23.910
That's 2 damage in addition 
to the 4 you already have.

00:15:23.910 --> 00:15:25.800
It's over.

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:29.940
Brings back memories, right?

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:34.000
Kai used this the first 
time you fought, didn't he?

00:15:35.720 --> 00:15:39.670
Why don't you show me how 
far you've come since then?

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:44.350
Although, for your information, 
I'm not as nice as Kai.

00:15:44.350 --> 00:15:47.630
Dragonic Overlord's Counterblast!

00:15:49.150 --> 00:15:50.880
+5000 power!

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:56.180
Oh, no!

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:58.220
Kamui the Great...?

00:15:58.220 --> 00:16:00.790
It ain't just +5000 power!

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:03.240
When Dragonic Overlord's attack 
hits its opponent's rear-guard,

00:16:03.240 --> 00:16:06.160
it can stand again!

00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:08.620
CA?!

00:16:08.620 --> 00:16:10.880
You mean he can do consecutive attacks?!

00:16:11.060 --> 00:16:13.420
Let's hold off on that fun 'til later...

00:16:13.510 --> 00:16:16.660
With a boost from Tahr, Sutherland attacks!

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:26.970
Brother!

00:16:29.930 --> 00:16:31.630
He has 5 damage...

00:16:32.030 --> 00:16:36.020
Okay, Garnet Dragon Flash is up next...

00:16:36.240 --> 00:16:42.030
If his attack goes through, I can use his 
skill to add +3000 power to any Kagero unit.

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:44.720
And of course, the unit I'm 
going to power up is...

00:16:47.090 --> 00:16:49.310
You can guard,

00:16:49.310 --> 00:16:55.070
but if you lose even one card in your hand, 
Dragonic Overlord burns the rest away.

00:16:56.860 --> 00:16:59.560
I attack with Garnet Dragon Flash!

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:10.920
I guard with Epona!

00:17:13.930 --> 00:17:15.580
First check...

00:17:16.380 --> 00:17:18.110
Second check!

00:17:19.710 --> 00:17:21.980
I give all the effects to Overlord!

00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:25.920
Monica boosts!

00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:30.170
Go! With the effects of the 
trigger and Monica's boost,

00:17:30.510 --> 00:17:33.460
Overlord has 26000 power!

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:40.450
He's as strong as an ogre!

00:17:41.050 --> 00:17:45.150
Burn everything to ashes! Eternal Flame!

00:18:05.150 --> 00:18:06.520
Iseult...

00:18:13.310 --> 00:18:15.610
He did it! Perfect defense!

00:18:17.680 --> 00:18:21.280
Dear me, it's not gonna work 
out the way it did with Kai?

00:18:21.610 --> 00:18:22.910
That's the end of my turn.

00:18:23.650 --> 00:18:25.550
You've changed, huh?

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:32.160
I stand and draw!

00:18:33.970 --> 00:18:35.500
God of the Knights!

00:18:36.020 --> 00:18:39.260
Appear and muster your mystical power! I ride...

00:18:40.640 --> 00:18:42.790
Soul Saver Dragon!

00:18:55.470 --> 00:18:57.110
That voice then...

00:18:58.060 --> 00:18:59.850
Holy Charging Roar!

00:19:00.260 --> 00:19:02.170
With Soul Saver's skill,

00:19:02.170 --> 00:19:08.860
I add +5000 to the power of Pegasus Knight, 
Flogal, and my other Soul Saver Dragon!

00:19:12.100 --> 00:19:13.690
Flogal boosts!

00:19:14.150 --> 00:19:16.340
I attack with Soul Saver Dragon!

00:19:22.710 --> 00:19:24.860
Lightning Judgment!

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:31.730
Twin drive check!

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:42.760
The winner is Aichi Sendou!

00:19:42.760 --> 00:19:45.180
And the champions of Card 
Capital's Shop Tournament are...

00:19:45.630 --> 00:19:47.540
Team Q4!

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:51.120
You did it, Brother!

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:51.570
Yep...

00:19:51.570 --> 00:19:52.650
You did well.

00:19:52.650 --> 00:19:54.010
Th-Thank you!

00:19:59.740 --> 00:20:02.750
Sorry, we've got a full house.

00:20:07.130 --> 00:20:08.660
Congrats!

00:20:09.550 --> 00:20:10.750
Miwa!

00:20:10.750 --> 00:20:12.330
Y'know, you've gotten stronger!

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:14.030
Not really...

00:20:14.390 --> 00:20:17.980
The cards just happened to speak to 
me, and they showed me the way...

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:23.370
Besides, it looks like Kai doesn't 
think I'm there yet either...

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:26.790
In any case, you're not the 
only one who's changed.

00:20:26.790 --> 00:20:31.430
Even <i>he's</i> changed a lot, compared 
to when he first moved back.

00:20:32.860 --> 00:20:36.190
I thought something good must've 
happened for him in this town.

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:39.270
And I confirmed it with today's fight!

00:20:39.810 --> 00:20:42.390
Ojaru! On your knees!

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:46.480
You're going to take responsibility for 
this failure and apologize-degozaru!

00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:48.680
You lost, too...

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:52.400
Give me back my big moment with Kourin!

00:20:52.400 --> 00:20:53.350
That's why he's upset...?

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:54.830
Don't act like it's no big deal!

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:56.500
I had my heart set on meeting her!

00:20:56.500 --> 00:20:58.410
Well, if you'll excuse me...

00:20:59.550 --> 00:21:01.080
You think I'll let you get away?!

00:21:01.080 --> 00:21:04.160
You're in the palace! You're in the palace!

00:21:04.510 --> 00:21:05.690
Later!

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:08.900
Congratulations, Aichi!

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:10.120
Emi!

00:21:12.130 --> 00:21:13.650
Thank you, Emi.

00:21:14.050 --> 00:21:16.360
Ms. Emi, you really are a goddess!

00:21:16.360 --> 00:21:18.600
Kamui the Great, you really took a beating!

00:21:18.600 --> 00:21:20.780
KTB, yo!

00:21:30.190 --> 00:21:31.640
I figured you'd be here.

00:21:32.620 --> 00:21:35.350
Invite me over to your place once in a while!

00:21:35.350 --> 00:21:38.740
You can serve milk tea and 
strawberry shortcake...

00:21:38.740 --> 00:21:40.970
You tracked me down to tell me that?

00:21:41.850 --> 00:21:44.560
Now, that was a fun fight!

00:21:44.560 --> 00:21:47.880
He's gettin' stronger 
and stronger as he goes.

00:21:47.880 --> 00:21:51.450
I can tell the future is 
gonna be fun, y'know?!

00:21:53.360 --> 00:21:55.730
But he said something strange...

00:21:56.060 --> 00:21:58.130
That the cards were talking 
to him or something...

00:22:00.150 --> 00:22:01.400
What?!

00:22:05.140 --> 00:22:07.870
Champions
Team Q4

00:23:50.950 --> 00:23:52.890
Miwa is really strong.

00:23:51.640 --> 00:23:54.650
Q4 Fight!
by the Mighty Morikawa and His Disciples

00:23:52.890 --> 00:23:54.620
Well, after all, he used to fight Kai,

00:23:54.620 --> 00:23:57.030
so I figured his skill 
level was really up there.

00:23:57.030 --> 00:24:00.870
But according to him, he gets moody, so 
serious fights aren't up his alley...

00:24:01.030 --> 00:24:02.410
It's a shame, really.

00:24:02.410 --> 00:24:05.620
But Miwa is cool when he's having 
a good time fighting, right?

00:24:05.620 --> 00:24:09.490
From my point of view, everyone in Team Q4 
looks cool because you're all having fun.

00:24:09.490 --> 00:24:11.400
Next time: Return to Regionals!

